# Guitar Mastery Academy — environment template.
# Copy to .env (never commit .env). Both values are PUBLIC client values:
# the Supabase anon/publishable key is designed to be shipped to browsers and is
# protected by Row Level Security. NEVER put the service-role key here or in any
# frontend code.
GMA_SUPABASE_URL=
GMA_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# Optional: public site URL used for auth email redirects (password recovery).
GMA_SITE_URL=
